<title>POLAND: DOMPLAST JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>DOMPLAST JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.37 vs   0.76</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.58 vs   1.66</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.84 vs   1.64</p>
<p> Sales		    7.58 vs   7.12</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.90 vs   5.18</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.88 vs  10.15</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.96 vs   9.76</p>
<p> Sales		   49.00 vs  40.94</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish plastic household products is</p>
<p>Domplast SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
